            <description><![CDATA[<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>SubFuse Beta 0.14.1</title></head><body>
<h2>Antigravity refresh starts the app for you</h2>
<ul>
<li>Update usage and Refresh all now open Antigravity in the background when needed, wait for its account service, then update usage.</li>
<li>An already-running Antigravity app is reused. Antigravity remains running after a refresh.</li>
<li>Startup has a time limit; sign-in, account mismatch, and other failures keep your last saved reading.</li>
<li>Scheduled refreshes still require Antigravity to be running. Sign in to the matching Google account in Antigravity first.</li>
</ul>
<p>Verified with Antigravity 2.29.0 and a Starter Quota account. Requires Apple Silicon and macOS 14 or later. Existing profiles are preserved.</p>
</body></html>
